This project is a PlatformIO + LovyanGFX port of the "Uncanny Eyes"
animatronic eye sketch:

- Eye graphics, asset tables and animation logic are adapted from
  https://github.com/dalori/ESP32-uncanny-eyes-halloween-skull (MIT),
  which in turn adapts the Adafruit "Uncanny Eyes" sketch by
  Phil Burgess for Adafruit Industries (MIT):
  https://github.com/adafruit/Uncanny_Eyes
- The display wiring approach (GC9A01 on ESP32-C3 Super Mini,
  pins in a project config file) follows
  https://github.com/synex-c21/ESP32-Plane-Radar-metrers

